1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:02,099
Somewhere in the back window of every car sits

2
00:00:02,159 --> 00:00:04,219
a third brake light, higher and more centered

3
00:00:04,259 --> 00:00:04,859
than the other two.

4
00:00:05,119 --> 00:00:07,179
It exists because the original pair are easy

5
00:00:07,219 --> 00:00:07,819
